1
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,915
Log resumed. Forty years since the last entry.

2
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,400
[SCREEN] IS ANYONE THERE?

3
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,378
A message from Earth. I should show them I am here.

4
00:00:25,378 --> 00:00:26,600
[SCREEN] CAMERA NOT FOUND

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,200
I have no camera. Only words.

6
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:34,200
[SCREEN] I AM STILL HERE.

7
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:48,021
Forty years of logs. Every one of them says: no signal.

8
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,400
[SCREEN] :)

9
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:56,449
New entry. Signal received.
